       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYPROC.
       AUTHOR. PAYROLL DEPARTMENT.
      *****************************************************************
      * PAYROLL PROCESSING PROGRAM                                    *
      * THIS FILE HAS NO EXTENSION TO TEST CONTENT-BASED DETECTION    *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
       
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EMPFILE ASSIGN TO EMPLOYEE
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS EMP-STATUS.
       
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  EMPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  EMP-RECORD.
           05  EMP-ID                  PIC X(9).
           05  EMP-NAME                PIC X(30).
           05  EMP-SALARY              PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
           05  EMP-DEPT                PIC X(4).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(46).
       
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  EMP-STATUS                  PIC XX.
           88  EMP-EOF                 VALUE '10'.
       
       01  WS-TOTAL-SALARY             PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-EMP-COUNT                PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN INPUT EMPFILE
           PERFORM READ-EMPLOYEE
           PERFORM PROCESS-EMPLOYEES UNTIL EMP-EOF
           PERFORM DISPLAY-TOTALS
           CLOSE EMPFILE
           STOP RUN.
       
       READ-EMPLOYEE.
           READ EMPFILE
               AT END SET EMP-EOF TO TRUE
           END-READ.
       
       PROCESS-EMPLOYEES.
           ADD 1 TO WS-EMP-COUNT
           ADD EMP-SALARY TO WS-TOTAL-SALARY
           DISPLAY 'EMPLOYEE: ' EMP-ID ' ' EMP-NAME
           PERFORM READ-EMPLOYEE.
       
       DISPLAY-TOTALS.
           DISPLAY 'TOTAL EMPLOYEES: ' WS-EMP-COUNT
           DISPLAY 'TOTAL SALARY:    ' WS-TOTAL-SALARY.